gate:* prune BEFORE the feature head (cut memory traffic). attention:select prunes AFTER it (FLOPs only).
If Δlat stays ~0 at B=1 but turns negative at large B, the workload was launch-bound at B=1 and the FLOP cut pays off once compute-bound.
